  "description": "Oh, the places you'll go on your Bridgeport ST, a lightweight Step-Thru aluminum bike with hill-conquering Shimano gearing, a comfy 63mm of front suspension, and safe and powerful mechanical disc brakes. Available in color choices as beautiful as the view, the Bridgeport ST is your Instagram-ready riding companion.\nHaro Solum Dual Sport Step-Thru frame with Rider Optimized Geometry, mechanically-shaped alloy tubing, and chainstay disc brake mount\nSR Suntour NEX HLO suspension fork with 63mm travel and hydraulic lockout\nShimano TY-301 crankset, 48/38/28t and sealed cartridge BB\nShimano Altus rear derailleur\nShimano Tourney 3x7-spd EZ Fire shifters\nShimano Tourney front derailleur\nPivit disc brake hubs w/ Alex DC-26 700c double wall rims\nPivit alloy 25mm riser bar w/ forged stem\nNew Pivit 2-Bolt zero offset seat post\nNew Tektro Aires MD-M280 mechanical disc brakes",
